- **Requires auth** (8 leads): probes confirmed `401 InvalidAuthenticationToken` on every authenticated Microsoft surface; Google data-plane endpoints all require auth.
- **Already reported/fixed** (4 leads): public commits (ADK e3567a6, 33012e6), an existing CVE (CVE-2026-47391), and prior public disclosures (Benchikh, Tenable TRA-2025-45).

